  6 | probe: fn() -[FS.Read("assets/")]> Bool {
    |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The signature declares `-[FS.Read("assets/")]>`, so the body may only use those; `FS.Read("secret.txt")` is outside that set
 Fix: Add `FS.Read("secret.txt")` to the effect list, or stop using it in `probe`
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: probe
